      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OX KNOX (4) has returned in fine order and made it two wins on the trot when he got home by nearly 2m at Kilmore last time. Came from this barrier to score at Melton prior. Yet to miss a place at this venue. Can strike again. MAXIMEZ (2) resumes here after closing his last campaign with a fifth at Melton in March. Won over this distance the only time he raced here. Draws well so expect him to be prominent. MAJESTIC TOOTH (5) found form when coming from wider for a last-start win by 5 metres at Melton. Led there so has the speed to go forward again. Could go on with it. AMOUR MATERNAL (3) could be close to a win after two successive seconds at Kilmore.",
